WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.540
- I love a reading.

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.310
- Oh!
- I love all the things,

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.140
but actually in my family,

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.253
like I come from a long
line of spiritually,

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.480
I don't know, enlightened people.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.920
Like my mother has what we

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:14.680
always called a really strong intuition.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.230
And she could always
kinda sniff things out.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:17.140
And even when we were younger,

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:18.210
she always knew what was going

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.100
on in our lives before we said anything.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.880
And my grandmother as well, and my brother

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.570
is actually properly able to read,

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.090
and he will know things
that I never even told him,

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.180
which is really wonderful.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.330
- Wow.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:30.660
- So I don't question it
- But kinda not

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.580
if you wanna keep a secret.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.413
(audience laughing)

00:00:33.413 --> 00:00:35.458
- I'm very much so held
accountable in my family.

00:00:35.458 --> 00:00:36.291
- (laughing) I was gonna say.

00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:38.625
- I'm like "Oh gosh,"
- That's harsh. (laughs)

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.327
- "there's really no pulling
the wool over your eyes."

00:00:40.327 --> 00:00:41.568
"There's nothing"

00:00:41.568 --> 00:00:42.401
"going on here."
- You just have to lie.

00:00:42.401 --> 00:00:43.276
No it's not.

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:44.860
It's not real
- And I am a bad actor

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.356
when it comes to reality.

00:00:46.356 --> 00:00:47.189
(laughing)

00:00:47.189 --> 00:00:49.010
I'm like, "Oh god, I can't lie to you!"

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:49.843
- I love it!

00:00:49.843 --> 00:00:51.360
- I'm getting hives everywhere.

